# =========================================================
#  电磁场与微波实验 — 仓库忽略规则
#  （LaTeX 报告 / AWR·ADS 仿真工程 / 教学资料）
# =========================================================

# ---------- LaTeX 构建产物 ----------
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.bcf
*.run.xml
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb
*.idx
*.ind
*.ilg
*.glg
*.glo
*.gls
*.acn
*.acr
*.alg
*.spl
*.brf
*.xdv
*.dvi
*.synctex
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex.gz(busy)
*.synctex(busy)
*.auxlock
*.upa
*.upb
*.sav
*.nlo
*.nls
*.listing
*.pdfsync
*-blx.bib
*.ent
*.4ct
*.4tc
*.lg
*.idv
*.xdy
*-converted-to.pdf
# 保留：*.tex / *.bib / *.sty / figures/ 一律入库（不写否定规则，靠不匹配实现）

# ---------- AWR / ADS 仿真工程 ----------
# 工程本体 (.emp/.vin)、原理图 (.sch)、版图 (.dxf) 保留
TEMP/
DATA_SETS/
*.dsp
*.dse
*.dds
*.dsf
*.ds
*.dgen
*.layout.ini
*.dxf.log
# 工程自动保存 / 锁定文件
*.lck
*.lock
*.old
*.orig
# 注意：DATA_SETS/ 与 TEMP/ 在 Windows 下大小写不敏感，Temp/、temp/ 同样被忽略

# ---------- Visual Studio / VS Code ----------
.vs/
.vscode/
*.vsidx
*.wsuo
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# ---------- MATLAB ----------
*.asv
*.autosave
*.mex*
*.slxc
slprj/

# ---------- Python ----------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.cache/

# ---------- Office / WPS 临时锁文件 ----------
# 打开 教学软件资料/实验报告封面模版.docx 时会生成 ~$实验报告封面模版.docx
~$*
*.wbk
*.asd

# ---------- 系统 / 编辑器临时文件 ----------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
._*
.directory
*.lnk
*.stackdump
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
*.swp
*.swo

# ---------- 大型安装包 / 压缩包 ----------
# 教学软件资料/ 下的 AWRDE 安装包约 263 MB，远超 GitHub 单文件 100 MB 上限，不入库
教学软件资料/*.zip
教学软件资料/*.7z
教学软件资料/*.rar
*.7z
*.rar
*.iso
*.exe
*.msi

# ---------- 构建输出 ----------
build/
out/
main.pdf
*.pdf.tmp

# ---------- 敏感信息 ----------
.env
*.license
*license*.key

